| R8 | Game-over shows cause, "Final score 10" (matched the score) and a "Play again" button (focused; Enter/Space also work). Played again three times without reload (Enter, button click, Space): each time score 0, length 3, head at (10,10) heading right, new food. | 07-gameover-self.png, play-log.txt |
